\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. O Master, let me walk with Thee
\par In lowly paths of service free;
\par Thy secret tell; help me to bear
\par The strain of toil, the fret of care;
\par Help me the slow of heart to move
\par By some clear winning word of love;
\par Teach me the wayward feet to stay,
\par And guide them in the homeward way.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Teach me Thy patience; still with Thee
\par In closer, dearer company,
\par In work that keeps faith sweet and strong,
\par In trust that triumphs over wrong,
\par In hope that sends a shinning ray
\par Far down the future's broadening way,
\par In peace that only Thou canst give,
\par With Thee, O Master, let me live!
\par Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

